   TC 2574 5g NSA Call                                  ${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}    egate_TC04
   TC 2574 DL UL Tput NSA Mode                          ${TestDSS10Mhz_2574_A1}
   ...                                                  ul_rate=${ul_expect_tput_value}
   ...                                                  dl_rate=${dl_expect_tput_value}
   ...                                                  alias=egate_TC04

   [Teardown]     Run Keywords       Teardown 2574     alias=egate_TC04           AND
   ...                               set Suite Variable  ${testCaseDir}  None

